===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*slēpaną}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*slab-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*slap-||to be weak, limp, languid}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|slēpa}} ({{cog|fy|sliepe}}), {{cog|osx|slāpan}} ({{cog|nds|slapen}}), {{cog|odt|slāpan}} ({{cog|nl|slapen}}), {{cog|goh|slāfan}} ({{cog|de|schlafen}}), {{cog|got|𐍃𐌻𐌴𐍀𐌰𐌽}}.

